# The Apple Team ID of the INDECIANA developer account: ten characters, uppercase, from Xcode →
# Settings → Accounts (beside the team) or App Store Connect → Membership.
#
# Paste it alone on the line below, with no quotes and no e-mail address. scripts/apple-association.mjs reads it to
# publish public/.well-known/apple-app-site-association, the file that lets a Saligue link sent on WhatsApp open the
# iPhone app instead of Safari — the iPhone's half of public/.well-known/assetlinks.json. Until a valid id is here
# nothing is published and iPhone links keep opening in a browser, which is the honest answer: Apple's CDN caches a
# wrong file for hours.
#
# A build can also be given one without touching this file: APPLE_TEAM_ID=A1B2C3D4E5 node scripts/build-app.mjs --apk
